{"sources":{"odeon":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"Verity - Dunkle Geheimnisse","lang":"DE","genre":["Thriller"],"dauer":114,"fsk":"14+","text":"Die junge Autorin Lowen Ashleigh (Dakota Johnson) erhält von Jeremy Crawford (Josh Hartnett) ein ungewöhnliches Angebot: Sie soll die erfolgreiche Buchreihe seiner Ehefrau Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) vollenden. Seit einem rätselhaften Unfall ist die Bestsellerautorin dazu selbst nicht mehr in der Lage.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61827/verity.webp?v=1791306293","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_ohZppCclN4","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/verity-dunkle-geheimnisse-de","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-09","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-13","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-14","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Bibi Blocksberg - Die total verhexte Zeitreise","lang":"DE","genre":[],"dauer":90,"fsk":"0+","text":"Eigentlich hatte sich Bibi (Nala) ihr Schulpraktikum ganz anders vorgestellt. Weil sie den regulären Termin verpasst hat, muss sie stattdessen zwei Wochen lang als Museumsaufseherin aushelfen. Während ihre Freundin Marita (Fia-Marie Lin) ihr Praktikum bei der Polizei absolviert und Florian (Aithonas Avgoustakis) für die Neustädter Zeitung arbeitet, scheint Bibi zunächst eine eher langweilige Zeit bevorzustehen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61778/bibi.webp?v=1790096422%2C0.4886%2C0.1962","trailer":"https://youtu.be/WH4JUkJei_w","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/bibi-blocksberg-die-total-verhexte-zeitreise","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"15:00"}]},{"title":"Digger","lang":"DE","genre":["Action-Komödie"],"dauer":129,"fsk":"10+","text":"Der in die Jahre gekommene, verschrobene, milliardenschwere Erdölmagnat Digger Rockwell (Tom Cruise) hat durch seine skrupellosen Geschäftstaktiken eine Umweltkatastrophe verursacht, die unter anderem das ewige Eis der Polarkappen schmelzen lässt und Tsunamis verursacht, die wiederum Atomkraftwerke beschädigen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/diggerDE.webp?v=1790695551%2C0.5046%2C0.1382","trailer":"https://youtu.be/c11Fbj1ikk4","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/digger-de","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-14","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Shaun das Schaf - Spuk im Kürbisfeld","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Animation"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"0+","text":"Auf der Mossy Bottom Farm laufen die Vorbereitungen für Halloween auf Hochtouren. Die Vorfreude der Schafherde wird jedoch jäh getrübt, als der tollpatschige Farmer versehentlich das Kürbisbeet zerstört. Entschlossen, das Fest doch noch zu retten, sucht Shaun nach einer Lösung und greift dabei zu ungewöhnlichen Mitteln.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/shaun.webp?v=1790695157%2C0.4954%2C0.7366","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_dk7a5t7t-o","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/shaun-das-schaf-spuk-im-kürbisfeld","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-09","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-13","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-14","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Eiserne Wildnis - Heart Of The Beast","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Action"],"dauer":100,"fsk":"10+","text":"Nach einem verheerenden Flugzeugabsturz strandet der ehemalige Special-Forces-Offizier James Belmont (Brad Pitt) gemeinsam mit seinem Militärhund Odin (Uber) in der abgeschiedenen Wildnis Alaskas. Von der Außenwelt abgeschnitten, sind die beiden ganz aufeinander angewiesen, um den extremen Bedingungen zu trotzen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61803/HeartBeast.webp?v=1790695254%2C0.555%2C0.2573","trailer":"https://youtu.be/tTZ73veD5DY","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/eiserne-wildnis-heart-of-the-beast","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-09","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-10","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-11","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-14","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Naza","lang":"IT","genre":["Dokumentatarfilm"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"10+","text":"Di notte, sui tetti di Tel Aviv, vanno in scena le registrazioni di testimonianze anonime da parte di operatori dell'intelligence e membri dell'esercito israeliano, che dal 2023 hanno preso parte ai sistematici spionaggio, sorveglianza e uccisione di civili palestinesi a Gaza.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61830/IWP_NAZA_poster_web.webp?v=1791306549","trailer":"https://youtu.be/PWNvM1_kdlw","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/naza-it","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-13","time":"18:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-10-13","time":"20:30"}]},{"title":"Heart Of The Beast","lang":"OV","genre":["Abenteuer","Action"],"dauer":100,"fsk":"10+","text":"After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont (Brad Pitt) and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements. From acclaimed filmmaker David Ayer, Heart of the Beast is an intense adventure thriller that explores the unbreakable bond between a man and his best friend as they face their greatest battle yet.","poster":"